I'M PRETTY SURE I WANT TO START A FAMILY
IN THE NEXT FIVE YEARS.

1661
01:25:52,345 --> 01:25:55,347
NICE. OKAY.

1662
01:25:55,849 --> 01:26:00,251
AND... YEAH, MAKE MORE FRIENDS

1663
01:26:00,453 --> 01:26:03,721
AND CLOSE PEOPLE I LOVE.

1664
01:26:03,989 --> 01:26:09,093
FOCUS ON BEING MORE CONNECTED TO
PEOPLE.

1665
01:26:09,495 --> 01:26:13,432
AND 20 YEARS?

1666
01:26:14,134 --> 01:26:16,403
20 YEARS.

1667
01:26:18,406 --> 01:26:22,941
I WANT TO HAVE HAD A
SUBSTANTIAL, POSITIVE IMPACT

1668
01:26:23,143 --> 01:26:25,309
ON THE FUTURE OF HUMANITY
BY THAT TIME.

1669
01:26:25,511 --> 01:26:28,079
DO YOU THINK YOU'RE GOING TO
LIVE FOREVER?

1670
01:26:28,148 --> 01:26:31,381
I THINK IT'S A POSSIBILITY
I HONESTLY DO.

1671
01:26:31,484 --> 01:26:34,218
I THINK I MIGHT LIVE FOREVER IN SOME FORM

1672
01:26:34,357 --> 01:26:39,224
BY THAT TIME
WITH TECHNOLOGIES CHANGING SO FAST.

1673
01:26:39,426 --> 01:26:42,328
COOL I HOPE I'M GOING THERE.

1674
01:26:43,129 --> 01:26:44,433
SWEET.